        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most women, the best treadmill running shoe is a light, comfortable neutral trainer,
            and the <strong class="text-white">Saucony Ride 19</strong> is the safest place to start.
            If width is your problem, the <strong class="text-white">New Balance 880 v15</strong> and
            ASICS GT-2000 15 come in women's narrow to extra wide; for long easy runs, the Gel-Nimbus
            28 has the most foam.
          </p>
